# The unit of work variation point attaches to the PostgreSQL example: it adds
# the command middleware, the unit of work over the context, and the sample
# command ImportItems with its scenarios, and changes only these files: the
# composition root, which registers it and lists the middleware, the abstractions
# project, which gains the reference that brings Shared to the Postgres project,
# and the readme.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-postgres-in-dotnet.skill/examples
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/Infrastructure/Postgres/Postgres.Abstractions/Postgres.Abstractions.csproj
change README.md
